# Wisecrack: "Target creature deals damage equal to its power to itself." The creature is the source of that damage, so its own abilities
# apply to it (CR 120.3, 702.2b, 702.15b): Bot1's Vampire Nighthawk (2/3, deathtouch and lifelink), not attacking, deals itself 2 on turn 3.
# The 2 is lethal from a source with deathtouch (CR 704.5h), so the Nighthawk dies with only 2 of its 3 toughness marked, and Bot1, its
# controller, gains 2 (22). Were Wisecrack the source, the Nighthawk would live and nobody would gain life.

